31: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::get()` is removed: read the bag the value comes from, the `attributes`, `query` or `request` property, such as `query->get()`, since symfony/http-foundation 7.4.
32: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::getContentType()` is replaced by `Request::getContentTypeFormat()`.
34: Static method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\JsonResponse::create()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\JsonResponse(...$args)`.
35: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\JsonResponse::setCallback()` is replaced by `setCallback(null)`.
39: Static method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::create()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response(...$args)`.
40: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::setExpires()` is replaced by `setExpires(null)`.
41: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::setLastModified()` is replaced by `setLastModified(null)`.
42: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::setEtag()` is replaced by `setEtag(null)`.
50: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RequestStack::getMasterRequest()` is replaced by `RequestStack::getMainRequest()`.
51: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::setFormat()` is replaced by `setFormat('', $mimeTypes)`.
53: Static method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RedirectResponse::create()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RedirectResponse(...$args)`.
60: Static method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\StreamedResponse::create()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\StreamedResponse(...$args)`.
63: Static method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\BinaryFileResponse::create()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\BinaryFileResponse(...$args)`.
69: Constructor `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\UriSigner::__construct()` is replaced by `new \Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\UriSigner($secret, hashParameter: $parameter)`.
79: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::setExpires()` is replaced by `setExpires(null)`.
80: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Response::setLastModified()` is replaced by `setLastModified(null)`.
90: Constant `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::HEADER_X_FORWARDED_ALL` is removed: use `HEADER_X_FORWARDED_FOR | HEADER_X_FORWARDED_HOST | HEADER_X_FORWARDED_PORT | HEADER_X_FORWARDED_PROTO`, the headers it stood for, since symfony/http-foundation 6.0.
96: Class `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RequestMatcher` is removed: create `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\ChainRequestMatcher` of the matchers in the namespace `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RequestMatcher`, since symfony/http-foundation 6.2.
97: Class `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\ExpressionRequestMatcher` is removed: create `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\RequestMatcher\ExpressionRequestMatcher`, which takes the language and the expression in its constructor, since symfony/http-foundation 6.2.
106: Class `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Session\Attribute\NamespacedAttributeBag` is removed: use `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Session\Attribute\AttributeBag`, which does not split a name into nested arrays, since symfony/http-foundation 6.0.
107: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Session\Storage\NativeSessionStorage::setMetadataBag()` is replaced by `setMetadataBag(null)`.
108: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Session\Storage\NativeSessionStorage::setSaveHandler()` is replaced by `setSaveHandler(null)`.
111: Method `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Session\Storage\MockArraySessionStorage::setMetadataBag()` is replaced by `setMetadataBag(null)`.
120: Writing to property `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::$query` is deprecated: pass the query parameters to the constructor or to `initialize()`, or change the bag itself, such as `$request->query->set()`, since symfony/http-foundation 8.1.
121: Writing to property `Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request::$attributes` is deprecated: pass the attributes to the constructor or to `initialize()`, or change the bag itself, such as `$request->attributes->set()`, since symfony/http-foundation 8.1.
